- Normalize whitespace and remove backtick fences when comparing names in the rule-based faithfulness check. ([#336](https://github.com/goldbarth/chartula/pull/336))
- Write an explicit no-changes sentence to `CHANGELOG.md` and release notes when the technical rendering is empty. ([#333](https://github.com/goldbarth/chartula/pull/333))
